          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kop a Rwot rik dok te bino baŋ Aggai tyen me aryo, i nino dwe pyeraryo wie aŋwen, kun kobbe ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kobbi Jerubabel, aloc me Juda, ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘An aceggi yeŋo polo kede lobo, dok daŋ abino reto kom me loc apol; aceggi daŋ tyeko teko me loc orok, ate daŋ rereto gadigadi me lwenygi oko karacel kede jo me riŋo kedgi, aguragura kede wegigi, ŋat acel acel bino to i pala lweny awottere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HAG 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nino-nono, Rwot me mony en oko bo, abino teri yin Jerubabel wot a Cealtiel, Rwot okobo, yin amirona, abino loki ibedo calo atemma me anen, pien an doŋ ayeri.’ Man kop a Rwot me mony ikokome.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HAG.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HAG.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
